 "text": "Delhi, ₹1 crore new flat: the real bill is ₹1.14 to 1.19 crore.\n\n₹6 lakh stamp duty, ₹1 lakh registration, ₹5 lakh GST while it's under construction, then parking and a broker on top.\n\nWe think the brochure price should include all of it. Or is it fair that buyers do this maths themselves? #HomeBuying"
}